---
const nodes = [
  { x: 12, label: '煮面' },
  { x: 90, label: '没葱了' },
  { x: 168, label: '出门买葱' },
  { x: 246, label: '找车钥匙' },
  { x: 324, label: '翻抽屉' },
  { x: 402, label: '高中相册' },
].map((node, index) => ({ ...node, y: 52 + index * 32, w: 66, h: 26 }));

const links = nodes.slice(0, -1).map((node, index) => {
  const next = nodes[index + 1];
  const x1 = node.x + node.w;
  const y1 = node.y + node.h / 2;
  const x2 = next.x - 2;
  const y2 = next.y + next.h / 2;
  return {
    curve: `M${x1} ${y1} C${x1 + 10} ${y1} ${x2 - 10} ${y2} ${x2} ${y2}`,
    tip: `M${x2 - 6} ${y2 - 3.5} L${x2} ${y2} L${x2 - 6} ${y2 + 3.5}`,
  };
});
---

<figure class="law-figure">
  <div class="law-figure-scroll">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 500 272"
      role="img"
      aria-label="一条任务链：想吃面，发现没葱，出门买葱要先找车钥匙，找钥匙翻抽屉，翻到高中相册，一路离最初的目标越来越远。"
    >
      <line x1="12" y1="34" x2="488" y2="34" class="viz-ref" />
      <text x="12" y="22" class="viz-note">最初的目标 · 吃碗面</text>

      {links.map((link) => (
        <>
          <path d={link.curve} class="viz-link" />
          <path d={link.tip} class="viz-tip" />
        </>
      ))}

      {nodes.map((node) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={node.x} y={node.y} width={node.w} height={node.h} rx="7" class="viz-node" />
          <text x={node.x + node.w / 2} y={node.y + 18} class="viz-node-label" text-anchor="middle">
            {node.label}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <text x="488" y="258" class="viz-note" text-anchor="end">已经忘了为什么要找钥匙</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    每一步都合理，加起来就不合理了。剪牦牛毛不是做错事，是没人回头看一眼最初那条线。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
